  narrativeGranted: She starts every morning with a workout after turning the extra
    bedroom into a personal gym. She listens to the news or a relevant lecture while
    doing cardio, only pausing to check metrics from the smart watch on her wrist.
    She brings the speaker with her everywhere in the house with backups in case
    the battery goes out.
